{% extends "base.html" %}{% block title %}RaktSetu | Home{% endblock %}{% block content %}
<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DONORS • PATIENTS • HOSPITALS • NGOs</span><h1>Every drop counts.<br><em>Every connection matters.</em></h1><p>Connect blood requests with potential donors by blood group and city. A simple digital bridge for a critical moment.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="{{ url_for('register') }}">Get started</a><a class="btn outline" href="{{ url_for('camps') }}">Explore camps</a></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="pulse">♥</div><div class="orbit o1"></div><div class="orbit o2"></div><div class="orbit o3"></div><span class="art-label">RAKTSETU NETWORK</span></div></section>
<section class="stats"><div><strong>{{ stats.donors }}</strong><span>Registered donors</span></div><div><strong>{{ stats.requests }}</strong><span>Active requests</span></div><div><strong>{{ stats.camps }}</strong><span>Donation camps</span></div></section>
<section class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>From request to response</h2></div><p>A clear five-step flow designed around trust and coordination.</p></section>
<div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Request</h3><p>Patient or hospital posts a blood requirement.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Match</h3><p>Potential donors are filtered by group and city.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Alert</h3><p>Matching requests appear on donor dashboards.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Confirm</h3><p>Donor expresses interest; details are confirmed.</p></div><div><b>05</b><h3>Donate</h3><p>Donation is coordinated with a licensed facility.</p></div></div>
<section class="request-preview"><div><span class="eyebrow">LATEST REQUESTS</span><h2>Requests needing attention</h2></div>{% if latest %}<div class="request-grid">{% for r in latest %}<article class="request-card"><span class="blood">{{ r.blood_group }}</span><div><h3>{{ r.patient_name }}</h3><p>{{ r.hospital }} · {{ r.city }}</p><small>{{ r.units }} unit(s) · {{ r.status|title }}</small></div></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p class="muted">No requests have been posted yet.</p>{% endif %}</section>
<div class="notice"><strong>Important:</strong> This is a student software prototype. It does not verify medical eligibility, guarantee blood availability, or replace hospital/blood-bank screening. In emergencies, contact a hospital or emergency services directly.</div>
{% endblock %}
